---
layout: repo_layout
parent: /apps.html
---

These rake tasks come from the `desc` descriptions in [<%= repo.repo_name %>'s `lib/tasks` folder](<%= repo.repo_url %>/tree/HEAD/lib/tasks).
To change what's shown here, change the description in the code.

<% repo.rake_tasks.each do |rake_task| %>
<% summary, more_details = rake_task[:description].split("\n", 2) %>

## <%= rake_task[:name] %>

<p class="govuk-body"><%= ERB::Util.h(summary) %></p>

<%= RunRakeTask.links(repo.deployment_name, rake_task[:command]) %>

<% if more_details.present? %>
<details class="govuk-details">
<summary class="govuk-details__summary"><span class="govuk-details__summary-text">More about this task</span></summary>
<div class="govuk-details__text"><pre><%= ERB::Util.h(more_details.strip) %></pre></div>
</details>
<% end %>

[View source](<%= rake_task[:source_url] %>) (`<%= rake_task[:source_path] %>`)

<% end %>
